ion.<br><br><b>Si cet accord pour r\u00e9duire la pauvret\u00e9 dans le monde \u00e9tait soumis \u00e0 r\u00e9f\u00e9rendum aujourd'hui et qu'il co\u00fbtait \u00e0 votre foyer une contribution obligatoire annuelle correspondant \u00e0 ${e:\/\/Field\/wtp_contribution}% de votre revenu (apr\u00e8s imp\u00f4ts), voteriez-vous pour ou contre cet accord ?\n<\/b><br><br><i>Avant de r\u00e9pondre, sachez que lors d'enqu\u00eates similaires, les r\u00e9pondants ont tendance \u00e0 accepter un montant qu'ils ne seraient en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 pas pr\u00eats \u00e0 payer. C'est ce qu'on appelle le \u00ab&nbsp;biais hypoth\u00e9tique&nbsp;\u00bb. Merci de r\u00e9pondre en tenant compte de votre budget r\u00e9el et de vos autres d\u00e9penses.<\/i>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"wtp","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Imaginez un accord entre l'Union Europ\u00e9enne et de nombreux pays \u00e0 bas revenus visant \u00e0 sortir 600...","Choices":{"13":{"Display":"Je voterais POUR cet accord qui me ferait contribuer ${e:\/\/Field\/wtp_contribution}% de mes revenus"},"14":{"Display":"Je voterais CONTRE cet accord"}},"ChoiceOrder":["13","14"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":15,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID129","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"time_budget\", Date.now()\/1000);\n\tconst time_before = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"time_program\");\n\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"duration_budget\", Date.now()\/1000 - time_before);\n\t\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is fully displayed*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID13","SecondaryAttribute":"Some people argue that Western countries owe reparations for colonization and slavery to former c...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Some people argue that Western countries owe reparations for colonization and slavery to former colonies and descendants of slaves. <br>Reparations could take the form of funding education and facilitating technology transfers, to address unequal opportunities passed down from the past. <br><br><b>Do you support or oppose reparations<\/b> of this kind <b>for colonization and slavery?&nbsp;<\/b><br>","DataExportTag":"reparations_support","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Some people argue that Western countries owe reparations for colonization and slavery to former c...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Strongly oppose"},"2":{"Display":"Somewhat oppose"},"3":{"Display":"Indifferent"},"4":{"Display":"Somewhat support"},"5":{"Display":"Strongly support"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":{"FR":{"QuestionText":"Certains soutiennent que les pays occidentaux doivent des r\u00e9parations pour la colonisation et l\u2019esclavage aux anciennes colonies et aux descendants d'esclaves.<br \/>\nLes r\u00e9parations pourraient prendre la forme d\u2019un financement de l\u2019\u00e9ducation et de transferts de technologie, afin de corriger les in\u00e9galit\u00e9s des chances h\u00e9rit\u00e9es du pass\u00e9.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong>\u00cates-vous favorable ou oppos\u00e9 \u00e0 de telles r\u00e9parations au titre de la colonisation et de l\u2019esclavage\u00a0?<\/strong>","Choices":{"1":{"Display":