ster actionnaire ou la revendre"}},"ChoiceOrder":[4,1,3,"9",7,6],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"CustomValidation","CustomValidation":{"Logic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID169\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/6","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Qui devrait h\u00e9riter d'une soci\u00e9t\u00e9 qui vaut 10 milliards d'euros lors du d\u00e9c\u00e8s de son actionnaire unique ?&amp;nbsp;Veuillez renseigner votre r\u00e9partition pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9e entre les diff\u00e9rentes options ci-dessou...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">L'ONU, afin de financer l'\u00e9ducation et la sant\u00e9 dans le monde entier<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> $e{q:\/\/QID169\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/6 + 100 - ${q:\/\/QID169\/TotalSum} } <\/span>","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID169\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/6","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"EqualTo","QuestionID":"QID169","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID169","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","RightOperand":"$e{q:\/\/QID169\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/6 + 100 - ${q:\/\/QID169\/TotalSum} }","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression"},"Message":{"description":"Require total sum of 100","libraryID":null,"messageID":null,"subMessageID":"VE_IMPORTANCE_TOTAL"}}}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":10,"NextAnswerId":4,"Labels":[],"Answers":{"1":{"Display":0},"2":{"Display":5},"3":{"Display":10},"4":{"Display":15},"5":{"Display":20},"6":{"Display":25},"7":{"Display":30},"8":{"Display":35},"9":{"Display":40},"10":{"Display":45},"11":{"Display":50},"12":{"Display":55},"13":{"Display":60},"14":{"Display":65},"15":{"Display":70},"16":{"Display":75},"17":{"Display":80},"18":{"Display":85},"19":{"Display":90},"20":{"Display":95},"21":{"Display":100}},"QuestionID":"QID169"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID17","SecondaryAttribute":"Consid\u00e9rez deux sc\u00e9narios possibles pour le monde dans les 20 prochaines ann\u00e9es. Sc\u00e9nario A : La","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Consid\u00e9rez deux sc\u00e9narios possibles pour le monde dans les 20 prochaines ann\u00e9es.<br>\n<br>\nSc\u00e9nario A<\/b> :<br>\nLa plupart des pays mettent en \u0153uvre des politiques coordonn\u00e9es pour limiter le r\u00e9chauffement climatique \u00e0 +2\u00b0C et r\u00e9duire les in\u00e9galit\u00e9s. Le monde r\u00e9duit consid\u00e9rablement les \u00e9missions de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre et est en bonne voie pour atteindre l'objectif climatique. Des imp\u00f4ts sur les millionnaires financent l\u2019installation de pompes \u00e0 chaleur, l\u2019isolation thermique des b\u00e2timents et l\u2019am\u00e9lioration des transports publics. Les yachts et les jets priv\u00e9s sont progressivement supprim\u00e9s dans le monde entier. Les voitures sont enti\u00e8rement \u00e9lectriques d\u2019ici 2045 et co\u00fbtent \u00e0 peu pr\u00e8s le m\u00eame prix que les voitures thermiques d\u2019aujourd\u2019hui. D\u2019ici 2045, les r\u00e9glementations environnementales multiplient progressivement par deux le prix du b\u0153uf, du fioul ou du gaz de chauffage, et du transport a\u00e9rien. En cons\u00e9quence, les gens prennent l\u2019avion deux fois moins souvent, mangent deux fois moins de viande et utilisent davantage les transports en commun en 2045 qu\u2019en 2025.&nbsp;Malgr\u00e9 des prix plus \u00e9lev\u00e9s pour les biens polluants, le pouvoir d\u2019achat g\u00e9n\u00e9ral est pr\u00e9serv\u00e9, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une baisse de la TVA qui r\u00e9duit les prix des biens non polluants.<br>\n<br>\n<b>Sc\u00e9nario B<\/b> :<br>\nDepuis 2025, aucune mesure suppl\u00e9mentaire n\u2019est mise en \u0153uvre pour lutter contre le changement climatique ou les in\u00e9galit\u00e9s. Les gens maintiennent le m\u00eame mode de vie qu\u2019en 2025. Par exemple, la plupart des gens continuent de conduire des voitures thermiques. Les \u00e9missions de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre sont stables. Le r\u00e9chauffement climatique devrait atteindre +3\u00b0C d\u2019ici 2100 et des niveaux plus \u00e9lev\u00e9s au-del\u00e0 de cette date. Le changement climatique entra\u00eene des s\u00e9cheresses, des vagues de chaleur, des incendies de for\u00eat et des inondations c\u00f4ti\u00e8res plus fr\u00e9quents et plus graves.<br>\n<br>\nHormis les \u00e9l\u00e9ments d\u00e9crits, les deux sc\u00e9narios sont identiques (par exemple, en termes de ch\u00f4mage ou de criminalit\u00e9).<br>\n<br>\n<b>Quel sc\u00e9nario pr\u00e9f\u00e9rez-vous pour l\u2019avenir ?<\/b>","DataExportTag":"sustainable_future_a","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Consid\u00e9rez deux sc\u00e9narios possibles pour le monde dans les 20 prochaines ann\u00e9es. Sc\u00e9nario A : La...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Sc\u00e9nario A"},"2":{"Display":"Sc\u00e9nario B"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":{"FR":{"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Sc\u00e9nario\u00a0A"},"2":{"Display":"Sc\u00e9nario B"}}}},"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID17","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<b>Consider two possible scenarios for the world for the next 20 years.&nbsp;<br><br>Scenario A<\/b>: <br>Most countries implement coordinated policies to limit global warming to +2\u00b0C and reduce inequality. The world greatly reduces greenhouse gas emissions and is on track to meet its climate target. Taxes on millionaires fund the installation of heat pumps, the thermal insulation of buildings, and improved public transportation. Yachts and private jets are phased out worldwide. Cars are all electric by 2045, and they are about the same price as internal combustion cars nowadays. By 2045, environmental regulations gradually double the price heating fuel or gas, air travel, and beef. As a result, people fly half as much, eat half as much meat, and use more public transportation in 2045 than they did in 2025. Despite higher prices for polluting goods, the overall purchasing power is preserved, thanks to a decrease in sales tax that reduces the prices of non-polluting goods.<br><br><b>Scenario B<\/b>:<br>Since 2025, no additional policies are implemented to address climate change or inequality. People maintain the same lifestyles as in 2025. For example, most people continue to drive cars with internal combustion engines. Greenhouse gas emissions are stable. Global warming is expected to reach +3\u00b0C by 2100 and higher levels beyond that date. A warmer climate will cause more frequent and more severe droughts, heatwaves, wildfires, and floodings.<br><br>Apart from the elements described, the two scenarios are the same (for example, in terms of unemployment or crime). <br><br><b>Which scenario do you prefer for the future?<\/b>","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"time_global_inheritance\", Date.now()\/1000);\n\tconst time_before = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"time_wealth_tax\");\n\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"duration_global_inheritance\", Date.now()\/1000 - time_before);\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is fully displayed*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID170","SecondaryAttribute":"Imaginez qu'il y ait une redistribution internationale des riches vers les pauvres. Dans ce cadre...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Les personnes qui ont pour seuls revenus les aides internationales devraient toucher (en \u20ac\/mois) :","TextEntry":"true","InputHeight":24,"InputWidth":350},"2":{"Display":"NSP (Ne sait pas, ne se prononce pas)"}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"custom_min_income","DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionDescription":"Imaginez qu'il y ait une redistribution internationale des riches vers les pauvres. Dans ce cadre...","QuestionID":"QID170","QuestionText":"Imaginez qu'il y ait une redistribution internationale des riches vers les pauvres. <br>Dans ce cadre, quel devrait \u00eatre le montant des aides pour les humains qui n'ont aucun revenu ?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Quel devrait \u00eatre le montant des aides de l'\u00c9tat pour les gens qui n'ont aucun revenu ?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None","CustomValidation":{"Logic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID29\/ChoiceTextEntryValue\/1","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Combien devraient gagner, chaque mois, ceux qui ne touchent que les aides de l'\u00c9tat ? (en euros)<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Ceux qui ne touche que les aides de l'\u00c9tat devrait gagner chaque mois :<\/span> Is <span class=\"OpDesc\">Greater Than or Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 0 <\/span>","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID29\/ChoiceTextEntryValue\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"GreaterThanOrEqual","QuestionID":"QID29","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID29","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","RightOperand":"0","Type":"Expression"},"1":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID29\/SelectableChoice\/2","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Combien devraient gagner, chaque mois, ceux qui ne touchent que les aides de l'\u00c9tat ? (en euros)<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">NSP (Ne sait pas, ne se prononce pas)<\/span> Is <span class=\"OpDesc