"QID178","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"SL","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Si vous souhaitez choisir votre budget pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9 sur un site plus amusant, complet et interactif, v...","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"LogicType":"BooleanValue","Value":"False","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span><span> False<\/span>"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID179","SecondaryAttribute":"Selon vous, le changement climatique ...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Selon vous, le changement climatique ...","DataExportTag":"climate_belief","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Selon vous, le changement climatique ...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"n'est pas une r\u00e9alit\u00e9"},"2":{"Display":"est principalement d\u00fb \u00e0 la variabilit\u00e9 naturelle du climat"},"3":{"Display":"est principalement d\u00fb \u00e0 l'activit\u00e9 humaine"},"4":{"Display":"est autant d\u00fb \u00e0 la variabilit\u00e9 naturelle qu'\u00e0 l'activit\u00e9 humaine"},"5":{"Display":"est enti\u00e8rement d\u00fb \u00e0 l'activit\u00e9 humaine"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","4","3","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID179","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"time_wtp\", Date.now()\/1000);\n\tconst time_before = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"time_budge