9rentes raisons \u00e9voqu\u00e9es, avec lesquelles \u00eates-vous d\u2019accord ? (R\u00e9ponses multiples possible)","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Les pays \u00e0 hauts revenus ont une <strong>responsabilit\u00e9 historique<\/strong> dans la situation actuelle des pays \u00e0 bas revenus."},"2":{"Display":"\u00c0 long terme, il est <strong>dans l\u2019int\u00e9r\u00eat des pays \u00e0 hauts revenus<\/strong> d\u2019aider les pays \u00e0 bas revenus."},"3":{"Display":"Il faut <strong>aider ceux qui sont dans le besoin<\/strong>. Ce principe s\u2019applique \u00e9galement \u00e0 l'\u00e9chelle internationale."},"5":{"Display":"Aucune des raisons ci-dessus."}}}},"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID18","Randomization":{"Advanced":{"FixedOrder":["{~Randomized~}","{~Randomized~}","{~Randomized~}","5"],"RandomSubSet":[],"RandomizeAll":["1","2","3"],"ScaleReversal":[],"TotalRandSubset":0,"Undisplayed":[]},"ConsistentScaleReversal":true,"EvenPresentation":false,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"Advanced"},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Some people think that high-income countries should support low-income countries.&nbsp;<br>Among the different reasons given, which ones do you agree with? (Multiple answers possible)"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID180","SecondaryAttribute":"Ce questionnaire \u00e9tait ...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Ce questionnaire \u00e9tait ...","DataExportTag":"difficulty","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"MAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Ce questionnaire \u00e9tait ...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Trop difficile, j'ai r\u00e9pondu un peu au hasard \u00e0 certaines questions difficiles \u00e0 comprendre"},"2":{"Display":"Difficile, je n'ai pas tout compris mais j'ai r\u00e9pondu du mieux que j'ai pu"},"3":{"Display":"Compr\u00e9hensible, m\u00eame s'il fallait r\u00e9fl\u00e9chir pour r\u00e9pondre"},"4":{"Display":"Facile \u00e0 comprendre, avec des questions bien pos\u00e9es"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID180"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID19","SecondaryAttribute":"all types of policies","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"all types of policies","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q19","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"all types of policies","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 1"},"2":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 2"},"3":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 3"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID19"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID2","SecondaryAttribute":"By taking this survey, you will be automatically entered into a lottery to win up to [amount_lott...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"By taking this survey, you will be automatically entered into a lottery to win up to <span class=\"amount_lottery\">[amount_lottery: $100]<\/span>. <br>Should you be selected in the lottery, you will have the option to channel a part of this additional compensation to the charity <i>Just One Tree<\/i> to plant trees.<br><br><b>In case you win the lottery, what share of the <span class=\"amount_lottery\">[amount_lottery: $100 prize]<\/span> would you donate to plant trees?<\/b>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"donation","QuestionID":"QID2","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":false,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"By taking this survey, you will be automatically entered into a lottery to win up to [amount_lott...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Share to plant trees"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":{"FR":{"QuestionText":"En r\u00e9pondant \u00e0 cette enqu\u00eate, vous \u00eates automatiquement inscrit \u00e0 une loterie pour gagner jusqu'\u00e0 <span class=\"amount_lottery\">100 $<\/span>.<br \/>\nSi vous \u00eates s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9\u22c5e au tirage au sort, vous pouvez reverser une partie de cette compensation suppl\u00e9mentaire pour planter des arbres. Nous transmettrons ce don \u00e0 l'association caritative Just One Tree, qui plante un arbre pour <span class=\"tree\">[tree: every dollar donated]<\/span>.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<b>Si vous gagnez la loterie, quelle part des <span class=\"amount_lottery\">100\u00a0$<\/span> donneriez-vous pour planter des arbres\u00a0?<\/b>","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Part pour planter des arbres"}}}},"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"Labels":[],"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">variant_warm_glow<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 2 <\/span>","LeftOperand":"variant_warm_glow","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"2","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"By taking this survey, you will be automatically entered into a lottery to win up to <span class=\"amount_lottery\">[amount_lottery: $100]<\/span>. <br>Should you be selected in the lottery, you will have the option to channel a part of this additional compensation to the charity <i>Just One Tree<\/i> to plant trees.<br><br><b>In case you win the lottery, what share of the <span class=\"amount_lottery\">[amount_lottery: $100 prize]<\/span> would you donate to plant trees?<\/b>","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"time_global_tax\", Date.now()\/1000);\n\tconst time_before = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"time_conjoint\");\n\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"duration_global_tax\", Date.now()\/1000 - time_before);\n\t\n\t\/\/ Loads CSV and create variables from the column corresponding to Q_Language\n\t\/\/ Loads CSV and create variables from the column corresponding to Q_Language\n\t$j(document).ready(function($j){\t\n\t\t$j.ajax({\n\t\t\turl:\"https:\/\/wumarketing.eu.qualtrics.com\/ControlPanel\/File.php?F=F_yuKEs6pwxsAid44\",\n\t\t\tsuccess: function(csv){\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tconst language = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"Q_Language\"); \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tconst rows = csv.split('\\n').map(row => row.split('|'));\n\t\t\tconst headers = rows[0];\n\t\t\tconst col = headers.indexOf(language);\n\n\t\t\tif (col === -1) {\n\t\t\t\tconsole.error(\"Column 'language' not found in the CSV file.\");\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t\/\/ Iterate through the rows and create variables dynamically\n\t\t\tfor (let i = 1; i < rows.length-1; i++) {\n\t\t\t\tconst name = rows[i][0]; \/\/ Assuming the row name is in the first column\n\t\t\t\tconst value = rows[i][col];\n\t\t\t\twindow[name] = value; \n\t\t\t\t$j(\".\" + name).html(value);\n\t\t\t\t$j(\"#\" + name).html(value);\n\t\t\t\tconsole.log(`Variable ${name} created with value: ${value}`);\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\terror: function(){ alert('Data could not be loaded');}\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID20","SecondaryAttribute":"Click to write the question text","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Click to write the question text","DefaultChoices":false,"Data