ection\">[election: \u00e9lections europ\u00e9ennes de 2024]<\/span> ?<br \/>\nM\u00eame si vous n'avez pas vot\u00e9 aux <span id=\"election\">[election: \u00e9lections europ\u00e9ennes de 2024]<\/span>, veuillez indiquer le candidat pour lequel vous \u00e9tiez le plus susceptible d'avoir vot\u00e9 ou qui repr\u00e9sente plus fid\u00e8lement vos opinions.<\/span>","Choices":{"4":{"Display":"Harris"},"5":{"Display":"Atout"},"6":{"Display":"Autre"},"13":{"Display":"je pr\u00e9f\u00e8re ne pas dire"}}}},"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":15,"QuestionDescription":"[text_vote: Which candidate did you vote for in the [election: 2024 European Parliament election]...","QuestionID":"QID57","QuestionText":"<span id=\"text_vote\">[text_vote: Which candidate did you vote for in the <span class=\"election\">[election: 2024 European Parliament election]<\/span>?<br>Even if you did not vote in the <span class=\"election\">[election: 2024 European Parliament election]<\/span>, please indicate the candidate that you were most likely to have voted for or who represents your views more closely.]<\/span>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span id=\"text_vote\">[text_vote: Which candidate did you vote for in the <span class=\"election\">[election: 2024 European Parliament election]<\/span>?<br>Even if you did not vote in the <span class=\"election\">[election: 2024 European Parliament election]<\/span>, please indicate the candidate that you were most likely to have voted for or who represents your views more closely.]<\/span>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SACOL","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\tconst voted = '${q:\/\/QID44\/SelectedChoicesRecode}';\n\n\t$j.ajax({\n\t\turl:\"https:\/\/wumarketing.eu.qualtrics.com\/ControlPanel\/File.php?F=F_yuKEs6pwxsAid44\",\n\t\tsuccess: function(csv){\n\n\t\t\tconst language = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"Q_Lan