"QuestionText":"Aunque no haya votado en las elecciones presidenciales de EE.UU. del 2020, por favor indique el candidato por el que hubiera votado con m\u00e1s probabilidad o que represente m\u00e1s fielmente sus puntos de vista","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Biden"},"2":{"Display":"Trump"},"3":{"Display":"Jorgensen"},"5":{"Display":"Prefiero no decirlo"}}}},"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":6,"QuestionDescription":"Even if you did not vote in the 2024 U.S. presidential election, please indicate the candidate th...","QuestionID":"QID58","QuestionText":"Even if you did not vote in the 2024 U.S. presidential election, please indicate the candidate that you were most likely to\nhave voted for or who represents your views more closely.","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Even if you did not vote in the 2020 U.S. presidential election, please indicate the candidate that you were most likely to\nhave voted for or who represents your views more closely.","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SACOL","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID59","SecondaryAttribute":"Which candidate did you vote for in the 2024 U.S. presidential election?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span id=\"question_vote\">Which candidate did you vote for in the 2024 U.S. presidential election?<\/span>","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n    if (\"${q:\/\/QID44\/ChoiceGroup\/SelectedChoices}\" !== \"Yes\") {\n        $j(\"#question_vote\").html(\n            \"Even if you did not vote in the 2024 U.S. presidential election, please indicate the candidate that you were most likely to have voted for or who represents your views more closely.\"\n        );\n\t}\n});","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q59","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SACOL","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","NumColumns":2},"QuestionDescription":"Which candidate did you vote for in the 2024 U.S. presidential election?","Choices":{"4":{"Display":"Harris"},"5":{"Display":"Trump"},"6":{"Display":"Other"},"13":{"Display":"Prefer not to say"}},"ChoiceOrder":["4","5","6","13"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":{"ES":{"QuestionText":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 candidato vot\u00f3 en las elecciones presidenciales de EE. UU. del 2020?","Choices":{"4":{"Display":"Biden"},"5":{"Display":"Trump"},"6":{"Display":"Jorgensen"},"13":{"Display":"Prefiero no decirlo"}}}},"NextChoiceId":15,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID59"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID6","SecondaryAttribute":"To ensure that you have attentively read the description below, we will ask some comprehension qu...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"To ensure that you have attentively read the description below, we will ask some comprehension questions later in the survey: those who get correct answers can win <span class=\"amount_lottery\">$100<\/span>.\n\n<br><br>In several international organizations, <b>countries have agreed to demonstrate some degree of solidarity in addressing global challenges<\/b>.<br>\nNegotiations are ongoing to implement specific mechanisms for sustainable development.<br><br>Here are a few examples:<br>\ud83d\udea2&nbsp;<b>The International Maritime Organization plans to reduce carbon emissions<\/b> from shipping and may <b>adopt a levy<\/b> on such emissions in 2025, <b>that could partly finance low-income countries<\/b>.<br>\ud83d\udce6&nbsp;Since 1970, <b>developed countries have agreed to contribute 0.7% of their GDP in foreign aid<\/b> and development assistance.<br>\n\ud83c\udf31 In international climate negotiations, <b>developed countries have committed to finance climate action in developing countries<\/b>. In 2009, they committed to provide $100 billion per year by 2020. In 2023, all countries agreed to set up a fund to help vulnerable countries cope with loss and damage from climate change. In 2024, the $100 billion goal was increased to $300 billion per year by 2035.<br>\ud83d\udcc8&nbsp;In 2021, 136 countries adopted a minimum tax rate of 15% on multinational profits.<br>\ud83d\udc8e In 2024, under the leadership of Brazil, <b>the G20 considered the introduction of a global tax<\/b> of 2% <b>on <\/b>the wealth of <b>billionaires<\/b>.\n<br>\ud83c\udf10&nbsp;In 2024, the UN General Assembly adopted the Pact for the Future, which foresees a reform of the UN Security Council to limit the power of its five permanent member and expand it to new members.<br>\ud83d\udd04 Led by the Prime Minister of Barbados and supported by the UN Secretary General, the Bridgetown initiative seeks a new financial system that would drive financial resources towards climate action and sustainable development.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"info_solidarity","QuestionID":"QID6","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"To ensure that you have attentively read the description below, we will ask some comprehension qu...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":{"FR":{"QuestionText":"Pour v\u00e9rifier que vous avez lu attentivement la description ci-dessous, nous poserons quelques questions de compr\u00e9hension plus tard dans l'enqu\u00eate : ceux qui r\u00e9pondent correctement peuvent gagner <span class=\"amount_lottery\">$100<\/span>.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nDans plusieurs organisations internationales, les pays ont convenu d\u2019une certaine solidarit\u00e9 pour traiter des d\u00e9fis mondiaux.<br \/>\nDes n\u00e9gociations sont en cours pour mettre en \u0153uvre des m\u00e9canismes sp\u00e9cifiques de d\u00e9veloppement durable.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nVoici quelques exemples :<br \/>\n\ud83d\udea2 En 2025, afin de r\u00e9duire les \u00e9missions de CO<sub>2<\/sub> du transport maritime, <b>l'Organisation maritime internationale a adopt\u00e9 une taxe internationale sur les \u00e9missions exc\u00e9dentaires du fioul maritime, qui devrait en partie financer les pays \u00e0 bas revenus<\/b>.<br \/>\n\ud83d\udce6 Depuis 1970, <strong>les pays d\u00e9velopp\u00e9s se sont engag\u00e9s \u00e0 contribuer 0,7% de leur PIB \u00e0 l'aide au d\u00e9veloppement<\/strong>.<br \/>\n\ud83c\udf31 Dans les n\u00e9gociations internationales sur le climat, <strong>les pays d\u00e9velopp\u00e9s se sont engag\u00e9s \u00e0 financer l'action climatique dans les pays en d\u00e9veloppement<\/strong>. En 2009, ils se sont engag\u00e9s \u00e0 fournir 100 milliards de dollars par an d\u2019ici 2020. En 2023, tous les pays ont convenu de cr\u00e9er un fonds pour aider les pays vuln\u00e9rables \u00e0 faire face aux pertes et pr\u00e9judices caus\u00e9s par le changement climatique. En 2024, l\u2019objectif de 100 milliards de dollars a \u00e9t\u00e9 port\u00e9 \u00e0 300 milliards de dollars par an d\u2019ici 2035.<br \/>\n\ud83d\udcc8 En 2021, 136 pays ont adopt\u00e9 un taux minimum de 15 % sur les profits des multinationales.<br \/>\n\ud83d\udc8e En 2024, sous l'impulsion du Br\u00e9sil, <strong>le G20 a \u00e9tudi\u00e9 l'instauration d'une taxe mondiale<\/strong> de 2% <strong>sur la fortune des milliardaires<\/strong>.<br \/>\n\ud83c\udf10 En 2024, l'Assembl\u00e9e g\u00e9n\u00e9rale de l'ONU a adopt\u00e9 le Pacte pour l'avenir, qui pr\u00e9voit une r\u00e9forme du Conseil de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 de l'ONU pour limiter le pouvoir de ses cinq membres permanents et l'\u00e9largir \u00e0 de nouveaux membres.<br \/>\n\ud83d\udd04 Men\u00e9e par la Premi\u00e8re ministre de la Barbade et soutenue par le Secr\u00e9taire g\u00e9n\u00e9ral de l'ONU, l'initiative Bridgetown vise un nouveau syst\u00e8me financier qui orienterait les ressources financi\u00e8res vers l'action climatique et le d\u00e9veloppement durable."}},"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">variant_realism<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 1 <\/span>","LeftOperand":"variant_realism","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"1","Type":"Expression"},"1":{"Conjuction":"And","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">And<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">long<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Greater Than<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 0.42 <\/span>","LeftOperand":"long","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"GreaterThan","RightOperand":"0.42","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"To ensure that you have attentively read the description below, we will ask some comprehension questions later in the survey: those who get correct answers can win <span class=\"amount_lottery\">$100<\/span>.\n\n<br><br>In several international organizations, <b>countries have agreed to demonstrate some degree of solidarity in addressing global challenges<\/b>.<br>\nNegotiations are ongoing to implement specific mechanisms for sustainable development.<br><br>Here are a few examples:<br>\ud83d\udea2&nbsp;<b>The International Maritime Organization plans to reduce carbon emissions<\/b> from shipping and may <b>adopt a levy<\/b> on such emissions in 2025, <b>that could partly finance low-income countries<\/b>.<br>\ud83d\udce6&nbsp;Since 1970, <b>developed countries have agreed to contribute 0.7% of their GDP in foreign aid<\/b> and development assistance.<br>\n\ud83c\udf31 In international climate negotiations, <b>developed countries have committed to finance climate action in developing countries<\/b>. In 2009, they committed to provide $100 billion per year by 2020. In 2023, all countries agreed to set up a fund to help vulnerable countries cope with loss and damage from climate change. In 2024, the $100 billion goal was increased to $300 billion per year by 2035.<br>\ud83d\udcc8&nbsp;In 2021, 136 countries adopted a minimum tax rate of 15% on multinational profits.<br>\ud83d\udc8e In 2024, under the leadership of Brazil, <b>the G20 considered the introduction of a global tax<\/b> of 2% <b>on <\/b>the wealth of <b>billionaires<\/b>.\n<br>\ud83c\udf10&nbsp;In 2024, the UN General Assembly adopted the Pact for the Future, which foresees a reform of the UN Security Council to limit the power of its five permanent member and expand it to new members.<br>\ud83d\udd04 Led by the Prime Minister of Barbados and supported by the UN Secretary General, the Bridgetown initiative seeks a new financial system that would drive financial resources towards climate action and sustainable development.","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"time_ics\", Date.now()\/1000);\n\tconst time_before = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"time_gcs\");\n\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"duration_ics\", Date.now()\/1000 - time_before);\n\t\n\t\/\/ Loads CSV and create variables from the column corresponding to Q_Language\n\t$j(document).ready(function($j){\t\n\t\t$j.ajax({\n\t\t\turl:\"https:\/\/wumarketing.eu.qualtrics.com\/ControlPanel\/File.php?F=F_yuKEs6pwxsAid44\",\n\t\t\tsuccess: function(csv){\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tconst language = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"Q_Language\"); \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tconst rows = csv.split('\\n').map(row => row.split('|'));\n\t\t\tconst headers = rows[0];\n\t\t\tconst col = headers.indexOf(language);\n\n\t\t\tif (col === -1) {\n\t\t\t\tconsole.error(\"Column 'language' not found in the CSV file.\");\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t\/\/ Iterate through the rows and create variables dynamically\n\t\t\tfor (let i = 1; i < rows.length-1; i++) {\n\t\t\t\tconst name = rows[i][0]; \/\/ Assuming the row name is in the first column\n\t\t\t\tconst value = rows[i][col];\n\t\t\t\twindow[name] = value; \n\t\t\t\t$j(\"#\" + name).html(value);\n\t\t\t\t$j(\".\" + name).html(value);\n\t\t\t\tconsole.log(`Variable ${name} created with value: ${value}`);\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\terror: function(){ alert('Data could not be loaded');}\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID60","SecondaryAttribute":"[text_vote: Which candidate did you vote for in the [election: 2024 European Parliament election]...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":["5","4","19","6","15","12","17","20","16","21","18","13"],"Choices":{"4":{"Display":"Conservative"},"5":{"Display":"Labour"},"6":{"Display":"Liberal Democrats"},"12":{"Display":"SNP"},"13":{"Display":"Prefer not to say"},"15":{"Display":"Green"},"16":{"Display":"DUP"},"17":{"Display":"Sinn F\u00e9in"},"18":{"Display":"Other"},"19":{"Display":"Reform UK"},"20":{"Display":"Plaid Cymru"},"21":{"Display":"Alliance Party of Northern Ireland"}},"Configuration":{"NumColumns":2,"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"vote_GB","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":{"FR":{"QuestionText":"Pour quel candidat avez-vous vot\u00e9 lors des \u00e9lections g\u00e9n\u00e9rales britanniques de 2019\u00a0?","Choices":{"5":{"Display":"Travail"},"4":{"Display":"Conservateur"},"19":{"Display":"F\u00eate du Brexit"},"6":{"Display":"D\u00e9mocrates lib\u00e9raux"},"15":{"Display":"Vert"},"12":{"Display":"SNP"},"17":{"Display":"Sinn fein"},"20":{"Display":"Plaid Cymru"},"16":{"Display":"DUP"},"21":{"Display":"Parti de l&#39;Alliance d&#39;Irlande du Nord"},"18":{"Display":"Autre"},"13":{"Display":"Je pr\u00e9f\u00e8re ne pas le dire"}}}},"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":22,"QuestionDescription":"[text_vote: Which candidate did you vote for in the [election: 2024 European Parliament election]...","QuestionID":"QID60","Ques