 a wealth tax applying on households with net worth above [tax_threshold: $5 million], ena...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Domestic: Education and Research"},"2":{"Display":"Domestic: Healthcare"},"3":{"Display":"Domestic: Defense"},"4":{"Display":"Domestic: Deficit reduction"},"5":{"Display":"Domestic: Justice and Police"},"13":{"Display":"Domestic: Retirement pensions"},"14":{"Display":"Domestic: Social welfare programs"},"15":{"Display":"Domestic: Infrastructure (public transport, water systems...)"},"16":{"Display":"Domestic: Income tax reduction"},"17":{"Display":"Global: Education and Healthcare in low-income countries"},"18":{"Display":"Global: Renewable energy and infrastructure to cope with climate change"},"19":{"Display":"Global: Loss and Damage Fund (to rebuild after climate disasters)"},"20":{"Display":"Global: Forestation and biodiversity projects"}},"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">variant_split<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 2 <\/span>","LeftOperand":"variant_split","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"2","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5,"13","14","15","16","17","18","19","20"],"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"ConsistentScaleReversal":false,"EvenPresentation":false,"TotalRandSubset":"6","Type":"SubSet"},"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"CustomValidation","CustomValidation":{"Logic":{"0":{"0":{"QuestionID":"QID62","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/20","Operator":"EqualTo","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID62","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/20","RightOperand":"$e{100 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/1 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/2 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/3 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/4 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/5 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/6 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/7 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/8 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/9 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/10 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/11 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/12 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/13}","Type":"Expression","LogicType":"Question","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Imagine a wealth tax applying on households with net worth above [tax_threshold: $5 million], enacted in all countries around the world.\n[tax_country_name: In the U.S.], the tax revenues collected ...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Global: Forestation and biodiversity projects<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> $e{100 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/1 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/2 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/3 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/4 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/5 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/6 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/7 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/8 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/9 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/10 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/11 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/12 - q:\/\/QID62\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/13} <\/span>"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression"},"Message":{"messageID":null,"subMessageID":"VE_IMPORTANCE_TOTAL","libraryID":null,"description":"Require total sum of 100"}}}},"GradingData":[],"Language":{"AR":{"Labels":[]},"FR":{"QuestionText":"Imaginez un imp\u00f4t sur la fortune s&#39;appliquant aux m\u00e9nages dont la valeur nette est sup\u00e9rieure \u00e0 <span id=\"tax_threshold\">5 millions de livres sterling<\/span> , promulgu\u00e9 dans tous les pays du monde.<br><br> <span id=\"tax_country_name\">Aux \u00c9tats-Unis<\/span> , les recettes fiscales collect\u00e9es s&#39;\u00e9l\u00e8veraient \u00e0 <span id=\"tax_revenue\">430 milliards de dollars<\/span> par an (soit <span id=\"tax_revenue_gdp\">2<\/span> % du PIB am\u00e9ricain), alors qu&#39;elles s&#39;\u00e9l\u00e8veraient \u00e0 1 milliard de dollars dans l&#39;ensemble des pays \u00e0 faible revenu (700 millions de personnes vivent dans un pays \u00e0 faible revenu). , la plupart en Afrique). Chaque pays conserverait une partie des recettes qu\u2019il collecte et l\u2019utiliserait \u00e0 diff\u00e9rentes fins nationales (services publics, programmes de protection sociale, r\u00e9ductions d\u2019imp\u00f4ts ou r\u00e9duction du d\u00e9ficit). La partie restante serait mise en commun au niveau mondial pour financer les services publics et les \u00e9nergies renouvelables dans les pays \u00e0 faible revenu.<br><br> Quel pourcentage des recettes mondiales de l\u2019imp\u00f4t sur la fortune devrait \u00eatre allou\u00e9 \u00e0 chaque cat\u00e9gorie ? Le total doit \u00eatre de 100.<br><br>","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"National\u00a0:\u00a0\u00e9ducation et recherche"},"2":{"Display":"Domestique\u00a0: soins de sant\u00e9 (Medicare, Medicaid)"},"3":{"Display":"National\u00a0:\u00a0D\u00e9fense"},"4":{"Display":"Int\u00e9rieur\u00a0: r\u00e9duction du d\u00e9ficit"},"5":{"Display":"Domestique\u00a0: justice et police"},"13":{"Display":"Domestique\u00a0: Pensions de retraite"},"14":{"Display":"Domestique\u00a0: programmes de protection sociale (EITC, SNAP, garde d&#39;enfants, pr\u00e9-maternelle...)"},"15":{"Display":"Domestique\u00a0: Infrastructures (transports publics, syst\u00e8mes d&#39;eau...)"},"16":{"Display":"National\u00a0: r\u00e9duction de l&#39;imp\u00f4t sur le revenu"},"17":{"Display":"Monde : \u00c9ducation et soins de sant\u00e9 dans les pays \u00e0 faible revenu"},"18":{"Display":"Mondial : \u00c9nergies et infrastructures renouvelables pour faire face au changement climatique"},"19":{"Display":"Mondial: Fonds pour les pertes et dommages (pour reconstruire apr\u00e8s les catastrophes climatiques)"},"20":{"Display":"Mondial\u00a0: projets de for\u00eat et de biodiversit\u00e9"}},"Labels":[]},"IT-CH":{"Labels":[]},"JA":{"Labels":[]},"PL":{"QuestionText":"Prosz\u0119 sobie wyobrazi\u0107, \u017ce zosta\u0142 wprowadzony podatek maj\u0105tkowy, kt\u00f3ry dotyczy\u0142by gospodarstw domowych o maj\u0105tku netto przekraczaj\u0105cym <span id=\"tax_threshold\">20 mln PLN<\/span>, we wszystkich krajach na ca\u0142ym \u015bwiecie.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span id=\"tax_country_name\">W Polsce<\/span> dochody z podatku wynios\u0142yby <span id=\"tax_revenue\">6 mld PLN <\/span>rocznie (tj. <span id=\"tax_revenue_gdp\">0,2<\/span>% PKB), podczas gdy we wszystkich krajach o niskich dochodach \u0142\u0105cznie wynios\u0142yby 1 mld USD (w krajach o niskich dochodach \u017cyje 700 milion\u00f3w ludzi, wi\u0119kszo\u015b\u0107 w Afryce). Ka\u017cdy kraj zachowa\u0142by cz\u0119\u015b\u0107 zebranego dochodu i wykorzysta\u0142by j\u0105 na r\u00f3\u017cne cele wewn\u0119trzne (us\u0142ugi publiczne, programy pomocy spo\u0142ecznej, ulgi podatkowe lub zmniejszenie deficytu bud\u017cetowego). Pozosta\u0142a cz\u0119\u015b\u0107 zosta\u0142aby zgromadzona na poziomie globalnym w celu finansowania us\u0142ug publicznych i energii odnawialnej w krajach o niskich dochodach.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nJaki odsetek globalnego podatku od maj\u0105tku powinien zosta\u0107 przydzielony do ka\u017cdej kategorii? Suma musi wynosi\u0107 100.<br \/>\n\u00a0","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"W kraju: edukacja i badania naukowe"},"2":{"Display":"W kraju: opieka zdrowotna"},"3":{"Display":"W kraju: obrona narodowa"},"4":{"Display":"W kraju: redukcja deficytu bud\u017cetowego"},"5":{"Display":"W kraju: s\u0105downictwo i policja"},"13":{"Display":"W kraju: emerytury"},"14":{"Display":"W kraju: programy pomocy spo\u0142ecznej"},"15":{"Display":"W kraju: infrastruktura (transport publiczny, gospodarka wodna...)"},"16":{"Display":"W kraju: obni\u017cka podatku dochodowego"},"17":{"Display":"Globalnie: edukacja i opieka zdrowotna w krajach o niskich dochodach"},"18":{"Display":"Globalnie: energia odnawialna i infrastruktura umo\u017cliwiaj\u0105ce radzenie sobie ze zmianami klimatu"},"19":{"Display":"Globalnie: fundusz strat i szk\u00f3d (odbudowa po katastrofach klimatycznych)"},"20":{"Display":"Globalnie: projekty dotycz\u0105ce zalesiania i r\u00f3\u017cnorodno\u015bci biologicznej"}},"Labels":[]},"RU":{"QuestionText":"\u041f\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u044c\u0442\u0435 \u0441\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u043d\u0430\u043b\u043e\u0433 \u043d\u0430 \u0431\u043e\u0433\u0430\u0442\u0441\u0442\u0432\u043e, \u043f\u0440\u0438\u043c\u0435\u043d\u044f\u0435\u043c\u044b\u0439 \u043a \u0434\u043e\u043c\u043e\u0445\u043e\u0437\u044f\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0430\u043c \u0441 \u0447\u0438\u0441\u0442\u044b\u043c \u043a\u0430\u043f\u0438\u0442\u0430\u043b\u043e\u043c \u0441\u0432\u044b\u0448\u0435 <span id=\"tax_threshold\">5 \u043c\u0438\u043b\u043b\u0438\u043e\u043d\u043e\u0432 \u0444\u0443\u043d\u0442\u043e\u0432 \u0441\u0442\u0435\u0440\u043b\u0438\u043d\u0433\u043e\u0432<\/span> , \u0432\u0432\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0432\u043e \u0432\u0441\u0435\u0445 \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0430\u0445 \u043c\u0438\u0440\u0430.<br><br> <span id=\"tax_country_name\">\u0412 \u0421\u0428\u0410<\/span> \u0441\u043e\u0431\u0440\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u043d\u0430\u043b\u043e\u0433\u043e\u0432\u044b\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0443\u043f\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0441\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u044f\u0442 <span id=\"tax_revenue\">430 \u043c\u0438\u043b\u043b\u0438\u0430\u0440\u0434\u043e\u0432 \u0434\u043e\u043b\u043b\u0430\u0440\u043e\u0432<\/span> \u0432 \u0433\u043e\u0434 (\u0442\u043e \u0435\u0441\u0442\u044c <span id=\"tax_revenue_gdp\">2<\/span> % \u0412\u0412\u041f \u0421\u0428\u0410), \u0432 \u0442\u043e \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u044f \u043a\u0430\u043a \u0432\u043e \u0432\u0441\u0435\u0445 \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0430\u0445 \u0441 \u043d\u0438\u0437\u043a\u0438\u043c \u0443\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043d\u0435\u043c \u0434\u043e\u0445\u043e\u0434\u0430, \u0432\u043c\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0435 \u0432\u0437\u044f\u0442\u044b\u0445, \u044d\u0442\u043e\u0442 \u043f\u043e\u043a\u0430\u0437\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c \u0441\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u0438\u0442 <span id=\"LIC_revenue\">1 \u043c\u0438\u043b\u043b\u0438\u0430\u0440\u0434 \u0434\u043e\u043b\u043b\u0430\u0440\u043e\u0432<\/span> (700 \u043c\u0438\u043b\u043b\u0438\u043e\u043d\u043e\u0432 \u0447\u0435\u043b\u043e\u0432\u0435\u043a \u0436\u0438\u0432\u0443\u0442 \u0432 \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0435 \u0441 \u043d\u0438\u0437\u043a\u0438\u043c \u0443\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043d\u0435\u043c \u0434\u043e\u0445\u043e\u0434\u0430). (\u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0438\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0432\u043e \u0438\u0437 \u043d\u0438\u0445 \u0432 \u0410\u0444\u0440\u0438\u043a\u0435). \u041a\u0430\u0436\u0434\u0430\u044f \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0430 \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0442 \u0443\u0434\u0435\u0440\u0436\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0447\u0430\u0441\u0442\u044c \u0441\u043e\u0431\u0440\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u0434\u043e\u0445\u043e\u0434\u043e\u0432 \u0438 \u0438\u0441\u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0438\u0445 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0440\u0430\u0437\u043b\u0438\u0447\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u0432\u043d\u0443\u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u043d\u0438\u0445 \u0446\u0435\u043b\u0435\u0439 (\u0433\u043e\u0441\u0443\u0434\u0430\u0440\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0443\u0441\u043b\u0443\u0433\u0438, \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0433\u0440\u0430\u043c\u043c\u044b \u0441\u043e\u0446\u0438\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e \u043e\u0431\u0435\u0441\u043f\u0435\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f, \u0441\u043d\u0438\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u043d\u0430\u043b\u043e\u0433\u043e\u0432 \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u0441\u043e\u043a\u0440\u0430\u0449\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0434\u0435\u0444\u0438\u0446\u0438\u0442\u0430). \u041e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u0448\u0430\u044f\u0441\u044f \u0447\u0430\u0441\u0442\u044c \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0442 \u043e\u0431\u044a\u0435\u0434\u0438\u043d\u0435\u043d\u0430 \u043d\u0430 \u0433\u043b\u043e\u0431\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u043c \u0443\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043d\u0435 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0444\u0438\u043d\u0430\u043d\u0441\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0433\u043e\u0441\u0443\u0434\u0430\u0440\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u0443\u0441\u043b\u0443\u0433 \u0438 \u0432\u043e\u0437\u043e\u0431\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u044f\u0435\u043c\u044b\u0445 \u0438\u0441\u0442\u043e\u0447\u043d\u0438\u043a\u043e\u0432 \u044d\u043d\u0435\u0440\u0433\u0438\u0438 \u0432 \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0430\u0445 \u0441 \u043d\u0438\u0437\u043a\u0438\u043c \u0443\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043d\u0435\u043c \u0434\u043e\u0445\u043e\u0434\u0430.<br><br> \u041a\u0430\u043a\u043e\u0439 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0446\u0435\u043d\u0442 \u043c\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u044b\u0445 \u0434\u043e\u0445\u043e\u0434\u043e\u0432 \u043e\u0442 \u043d\u0430\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0430 \u043d\u0430 \u0431\u043e\u0433\u0430\u0442\u0441\u0442\u0432\u043e \u0441\u043b\u0435\u0434\u0443\u0435\u0442 \u0432\u044b\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0438\u0442\u044c \u043d\u0430 \u043a\u0430\u0436\u0434\u0443\u044e \u043a\u0430\u0442\u0435\u0433\u043e\u0440\u0438\u044e? \u041e\u0431\u0449\u0430\u044f \u0441\u0443\u043c\u043c\u0430 \u0434\u043e\u043b\u0436\u043d\u0430 \u0431\u044b\u0442\u044c 100.<br><br>","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"\u0412\u043d\u0443\u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u043d\u0435\u0435: \u043e\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0437\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0438 \u0438\u0441\u0441\u043b\u0435\u0434\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044f"},"2":{"Display":"\u0412\u043d\u0443\u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u043d\u0435\u0435: \u0417\u0434\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043e\u043e\u0445\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 (Medicare, Medicaid)"},"3":{"Display":"\u0412\u043d\u0443\u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u043d\u0438\u0435: \u041e\u0431\u043e\u0440\u043e\u043d\u0430"},"4":{"Display":"\u0412\u043d\u0443\u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u043d\u0438\u0435: \u0421\u043e\u043a\u0440\u0430\u0449\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0434\u0435\u0444\u0438\u0446\u0438\u0442\u0430"},"5":{"Display":"\u0412\u043d\u0443\u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u043d\u0438\u0435: \u041f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043e\u0441\u0443\u0434\u0438\u0435 \u0438 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u0438\u0446\u0438\u044f"},"13":{"Display":"\u0412\u043d\u0443\u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u043d\u0438\u0435: \u041f\u0435\u043d\u0441\u0438\u0438 \u043f\u043e \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0438"},"14":{"Display":"\u0412\u043d\u0443\u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u043d\u0438\u0435: \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0433\u0440\u0430\u043c\u043c\u044b \u0441\u043e\u0446\u0438\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e \u043e\u0431\u0435\u0441\u043f\u0435\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f (EITC, SNAP, \u0443\u0445\u043e\u0434 \u0437\u0430 \u0434\u0435\u0442\u044c\u043c\u0438, \u0434\u043e\u0448\u043a\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0435 \u043e\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0437\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435...)"},"15":{"Display":"\u0412\u043d\u0443\u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u043d\u0438\u0435: \u0418\u043d\u0444\u0440\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0443\u043a\u0442\u0443\u0440\u0430 (\u043e\u0431\u0449\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0442\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0441\u043f\u043e\u0440\u0442, \u0441\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0435\u043c\u044b \u0432\u043e\u0434\u043e\u0441\u043d\u0430\u0431\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f...)"},"16":{"Display":"\u0412\u043d\u0443\u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u043d\u0438\u0435: \u0441\u043d\u0438\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u0434\u043e\u0445\u043e\u0434\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e \u043d\u0430\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0430"},"17":{"Display":"\u0413\u043b\u043e\u0431\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e: \u043e\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0437\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0438 \u0437\u0434\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043e\u043e\u0445\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0432 \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0430\u0445 \u0441 \u043d\u0438\u0437\u043a\u0438\u043c \u0443\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043d\u0435\u043c \u0434\u043e\u0445\u043e\u0434\u0430"},"18":{"Display":"\u0413\u043b\u043e\u0431\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e: \u0412\u043e\u0437\u043e\u0431\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u044f\u0435\u043c\u0430\u044f \u044d\u043d\u0435\u0440\u0433\u0438\u044f \u0438 \u0438\u043d\u0444\u0440\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0443\u043a\u0442\u0443\u0440\u0430 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0431\u043e\u0440\u044c\u0431\u044b \u0441 \u0438\u0437\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435\u043c \u043a\u043b\u0438\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0430"},"19":{"Display":"\u0413\u043b\u043e\u0431\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e: \u0424\u043e\u043d\u0434 \u043f\u043e\u0442\u0435\u0440\u044c \u0438 \u0443\u0449\u0435\u0440\u0431\u0430 (\u0434\u043b\u044f \u0432\u043e\u0441\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u043f\u043e\u0441\u043b\u0435 \u043a\u043b\u0438\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0445 \u043a\u0430\u0442\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0444)"},"20":{"Display":"\u0413\u043b\u043e\u0431\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e: \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0435\u043a\u0442\u044b \u0432 \u043e\u0431\u043b\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0438 \u043b\u0435\u0441\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0445\u043e\u0437\u044f\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0430 \u0438 \u0431\u0438\u043e\u0440\u0430\u0437\u043d\u043e\u043e\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0438\u044f"}},"Labels":[]}},"NextChoiceId":21,"NextAnswerId":4,"Labels":[],"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Imagine a wealth tax applying on households with net worth above \u00a35 million, enacted in all countries around the world.\n<br><br>In the U.S., the tax revenues collected would be $430 billion per year (that is, 2% of U.S. GDP), while it would be $1 billion in all low-income countries taken together (700 million people live in a low-income country, most of them in Africa).\nEach country would retain part of the revenues it collects and use it for different domestic purposes (public services, social welfare programs, tax reductions or deficit reduction), while the remaining part would be pooled at the global level to finance low-carbon infrastructure and public services in low-income countries.\n<br><br>What percentage of the global wealth tax revenue should be allocated to each category?&nbsp;The total must be 100.<br><br>","Answers":{"1":{"Display":0},"2":{"Display":5},"3":{"Display":10},"4":{"Display":15},"5":{"Display":20},"6":{"Display":25},"7":{"Display":30},"8":{"Display":35},"9":{"Display":40},"10":{"Display":45},"11":{"Display":50},"12":{"Display":55},"13":{"Display":60},"14":{"Display":65},"15":{"Display":70},"16":{"Display":75},"17":{"Display":80},"18":{"Display":85},"19":{"Display":90},"20":{"Display":95},"21":{"Display":100}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID63","SecondaryAttribute":"Merci de s\u00e9lectionner \"Un peu\" (ceci est un test pour v\u00e9rifier que vous \u00eates attentif\/ve).","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Pas du tout"},"2":{"Display":"Un peu"},"3":{"Display":"Beaucoup"},"4":{"Display":"Compl\u00e8tement"}},"Configuration":{"LabelPosition":"BELOW","QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"attention_test","Language":{"FR":{"QuestionText":"Merci de s\u00e9lectionner \"Un peu\" (ceci est un test pour v\u00e9rifier que vous \u00eates attentif\/ve).","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Pas du tout"},"2":{"Display":"Un peu"},"3":{"Display":"Beaucoup"},"4":{"Display":"Compl\u00e8tement"}}}},"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":5,"QuestionDescription":"Merci de s\u00e9lectionner \"Un peu\" (ceci est un test pour v\u00e9rifier que vous \u00eates attentif\/ve).","QuestionID":"QID63","QuestionText":"Merci de s\u00e9lectionner \"Un peu\" (ceci est un test pour v\u00e9rifier que vous \u00eates attentif\/ve).","QuestionText_Unsafe":"To show that you are attentive, please select \"A little\" in the following list:","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID64","SecondaryAttribute":"Below is a map showing a possible set of countries that would participate in the Global Climate S...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Below is a map showing a possible set of countries that would participate in the Global Climate Scheme previously described.<br>\n<br>\nThese countries include China, India, <span id=\"text_countries_high\">[text_countries_high: the European Union, Japan, the United Kingdom]<\/span>, Canada, South Korea, as well as all Africa, Latin America, South-Asia and South-East Asia. <br>\nCollectively, these <span id=\"nb_countries_high\">[nb_countries_high: 153]<\/span> countries account for <span id=\"emissions_high_without\">[emissions_high_without: 72]<\/span>% of global emissions<span id=\"text_emissions_with\"> (if <span id=\"ics_country\">[ics_country: the U.S.]<\/span> joined them, <span id=\"emissions_high_with\">[emissions_high_with: 86]<\/span>% of global emissions would be covered)<\/span>.<br><br>Note that a provision would prevent the Global Climate Scheme from harming low- and middle-income countries: this is why countries like China, Mexico, or Egypt are in white on the map (they would neither win nor lose financially).<br>\n<br>\n<img src=\"https:\/\/github.com\/bixiou\/robustness_global_redistr\/raw\/main\/figures\/maps_participation\/GCS_high_color.PNG\" id=\"gcs_high_color\" width=\"100\" style=\"width: 100%\">","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"gcs_high_color","QuestionID":"QID64","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Below is a map showing a possible set of countries that would participate in the Global Climate S...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":{"FR":{"QuestionText":"Vous trouverez ci-dessous une carte montrant un ensemble possible de pays qui participeraient au Plan mondial pour le climat d\u00e9crit pr\u00e9c\u00e9demment.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nCes pays comprennent la Chine, l\u2019Inde, <span id=\"text_countries_high\">le Japon<\/span>, le Canada, la Cor\u00e9e du Sud, ainsi que toute l\u2019Afrique, l\u2019Am\u00e9rique latine, l\u2019Asie du Sud et l\u2019Asie du Sud-Est.<br \/>\nEnsemble, ces <span id=\"nb_countries_high\">153<\/span> pays totalisent <span id=\"emissions_high_without\">72<\/span>\u00a0% des \u00e9missions mondiales<span id=\"text_emissions_with\"> (si <span class=\"ics_country\">les \u00c9tats-Unis<\/span> les rejoignait, <span id=\"emissions_high_with\">86<\/span>\u00a0% des \u00e9missions mondiales seraient couvertes)<\/span>.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nNotez qu\u2019une disposition emp\u00eacherait le Plan mondial pour le climat de nuire aux pays \u00e0 revenus bas ou interm\u00e9diaires : c\u2019est pourquoi des pays comme la Chine, le Mexique ou l\u2019\u00c9gypte sont en blanc sur la carte (ils ne seraient ni gagnant ni perdant financi\u00e8rement).<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<img id=\"gcs_high_color\" src=\"https:\/\/github.com\/bixiou\/robustness_global_redistr\/raw\/main\/figures\/maps_participation\/GCS_high_color.PNG\" style=\"width: 100%\" width=\"100\" \/>"}},"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Below is a map showing a possible set of countries that would participate in the Global Climate Scheme previously described.<br>\n<br>\nThese countries include China, India, <span id=\"text_countries_high\">[text_countries_high: the European Union, Japan, the United Kingdom]<\/span>, Canada, South Korea, as well as all Africa, Latin America, South-Asia and South-East Asia. <br>\nCollectively, these <span id=\"nb_countries_high\">[nb_countries_high: 153]<\/span> countries account for <span id=\"emissions_high_without\">[emissions_high_without: 72]<\/span>% of global emissions<span id=\"text_emissions_with\"> (if <span id=\"ics_country\">[ics_country: the U.S.]<\/span> joined them, <span id=\"emissions_high_with\">[emissions_high_with: 86]<\/span>% of global emissions would be covered)<\/span>.<br><br>Note that a provision would prevent the Global Climate Scheme from harming low- and middle-income countries: this is why countries like China, Mexico, or Egypt are in white on the map (they would neither win nor lose financially).<br>\n<br>\n<img src=\"https:\/\/github.com\/bixiou\/robustness_global_redistr\/raw\/main\/figures\/maps_participation\/GCS_high_color.PNG\" id=\"gcs_high_color\" width=\"100\" style=\"width: 100%\">","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"time_gcs\", Date.now()\/1000);\n\tconst time_before = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"time_warm_glow_substitute\");\n\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"duration_gcs\", Date.now()\/1000 - time_before);\n\t\n\t\/\/ Loads CSV and create variables from the column corresponding to Q_Language\n\t$j(document).ready(function($j){\t\n\t\t$j.ajax({\n\t\t\turl:\"https:\/\/wumarketing.eu.qualtrics.com\/ControlPanel\/File.php?F=F_yuKEs6pwxsAid44\",\n\t\t\tsuccess: function(csv){\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tconst language = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"Q_Language\");\n\t\t\tconst country = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"country\");  \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tif (country == \"CH\") { $j(\"#text_emissions_with\").html(\"\"); }\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tconst rows = csv.split('\\n').map(row => row.split('|'));\n\t\t\tconst headers = rows[0];\n\t\t\tconst col = headers.indexOf(language);\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\tif (col === -1) {\n\t\t\t\tconsole.error(\"Column 'language' not found in the CSV file.\");\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t$j(\"#gcs_high_color\").attr(\"src\", \"https:\/\/github.com\/bixiou\/robustness_global_redistr\/raw\/main\/figures\/maps_participation\/GCS_high_color_\" + language + \".png\");\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\/\/ Iterate through the rows and create variables dynamically\n\t\t\tfor (let i = 1; i < rows.length-1; i++) {\n\t\t\t\tconst name = rows[i][0]; \/\/ Assuming the row name is in the first column\n\t\t\t\tconst value = rows[i][col];\n\t\t\t\twindow[name] = value; \n\t\t\t\t$j(\"#\" + name).html(value);\n\t\t\t\t$j(\".\" + name).html(value);\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tconsole.log(`Variable ${name} created with value: ${value}`);\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"variant_gcs\", \"high_color\"); \n\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\terror: function(){ alert('Data could not be loaded');}\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID65","SecondaryAttribute":"Below is a map showing a possible set of countries that would participate in the Global Climate S...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Below is a map showing a possible set of countries that would participate in the Global Climate Scheme previously described.<br>\n<br>\nThese countries include India<span id=\"text_eu\">, the European Union,<\/span> as well as all Africa, Latin America, South-Asia and South-East Asia.<br>\nCollectively, these <span id=\"nb_countries_low\">[nb_countries_low: 145]<\/span> countries account for <span id=\"emissions_low_without\">[emissions_low_without: 40]<\/span>% of global emissions<span id=\"text_emissions_with\"> (if <span id=\"ics_country\">[ics_country: the U.S.]<\/span> joined them, <span id=\"emissions_low_with\">[emissions_low_with: 40]<\/span>% of global emissions would be covered)<\/span>.<br>\n<br>\n<img src=\"https:\/\/github.com\/bixiou\/robustness_global_redistr\/raw\/main\/figures\/maps_participation\/GCS_low.png\" id=\"gcs_low\" width=\"100\" style=\"width: 100%\">","DefaultChoices":false,"Da