oiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":{"FR":{"QuestionText":"Vous trouverez ci-dessous une carte montrant un ensemble possible de pays qui participeraient au Plan mondial pour le climat d\u00e9crit pr\u00e9c\u00e9demment.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nCes pays comprennent la Chine, l\u2019Inde, <span id=\"text_countries_high\">le Japon<\/span>, le Canada, la Cor\u00e9e du Sud, ainsi que toute l\u2019Afrique, l\u2019Am\u00e9rique latine, l\u2019Asie du Sud et l\u2019Asie du Sud-Est.<br \/>\nEnsemble, ces <span id=\"nb_countries_high\">153<\/span> pays totalisent <span id=\"emissions_high_without\">70<\/span>\u00a0% des \u00e9missions mondiales<span id=\"text_emissions_with\"> (si <span class=\"ics_country\">les \u00c9tats-Unis<\/span> les rejoignaient, <span id=\"emissions_high_with\">86<\/span>\u00a0% des \u00e9missions mondiales seraient couvertes)<\/span>.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<img id=\"gcs_high\" src=\"https:\/\/github.com\/bixiou\/robustness_global_redistr\/raw\/main\/figures\/maps_participation\/GCS_high.png\" style=\"width: 100%\" width=\"100\" \/>"}},"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Below is a map showing a possible set of countries that would participate in the Global Climate Scheme previously described.<br>\n<br>\nThese countries include China, India, <span id=\"text_countries_high\">[text_countries_high: the European Union, Japan, the United Kingdom]<\/span>, Canada, South Korea, as well as all Africa, Latin America, South-Asia and South-East Asia.&nbsp;<br>\nCollectively, these <span id=\"nb_countries_high\">[nb_countries_high: 153]<\/span> countries account for <span id=\"emissions_high_without\">[emissions_high_without: 71]<\/span>% of global emissions<span id=\"text_emissions_with\"> (if <span id=\"ics_country\">[ics_country: the U.S.]<\/span> joined them, <span id=\"emissions_high_with\">[emissions_high_with: 86]<\/span>% of global emissions would be covered)<\/span>.<br>\n<br>\n<img  style=\"width: