SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID7","SecondaryAttribute":"Do you support or oppose the following policies? [developed_note_long: (As some items refer to \"d...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Do you support or oppose the following policies?<br><br><span id=\"developed_note_long\">[developed_note_long: (As some items refer to \"developed countries\", note that we consider Saudi Arabia to be a developed country in this question.)]<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"solidarity_support","QuestionID":"QID7","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidth":25,"RepeatHeaders":"both","MobileFirst":true,"NumColumns":1,"WhiteSpace":"OFF"},"QuestionDescription":"Do you support or oppose the following policies? [developed_note_long: (As some items refer to \"d...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Institutions like the World Bank investing in many more sustainable projects in lower-income countries, and offering lower interest rates (the Bridgetown initiative)"},"2":{"Display":"Developed countries financing a fund to help vulnerable countries cope with loss and damage from climate change"},"4":{"Display":"Expanding the UN Security Council (in charge of peacekeeping) to new permanent members such as India, Brazil, and the African Union, and restricting the use of the veto"},"5":{"Display":"Raising the globally agreed minimum tax rate on profits of multinational firms from 15% to 35%, closing loopholes and allocating revenues to countries where sales are made"},"6":{"Display":"Debt relief for vulnerable countries by suspending repayments until they are better able to repay, promoting their development"},"7":{"Display":"An international levy on carbon emissions from shipping, funding national budgets in proportion to population"},"8":{"Display":"An international levy on carbon emissions from aviation, raising ticket prices by 30% and funding national budgets in proportion to population"},"9":{"Display":"Developed countries providing $300 billion a year (0.4% of their GDP) to finance climate action in developing countries"},"10":{"Display":"Developed countries contributing at least 0.7% of their GDP in foreign aid and development assistance"},"11":{"Display":"A minimum tax of 2% on the wealth of billionaires, in voluntary countries"}},"ChoiceOrder":["11",5,4,10,6,1,2,9,7,8],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":{"FR":{"QuestionText":"\u00cates-vous favorable ou oppos\u00e9\u22c5e aux mesures politiques suivantes\u00a0?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Des investissements d'institutions comme la Banque mondiale dans bien plus de projets de d\u00e9veloppement durables dans les pays \u00e0 bas revenus, et \u00e0 des taux d'int\u00e9r\u00eat plus bas (l'initiative de Bridgetown)"},"2":{"Display":"Le financement par les pays d\u00e9velopp\u00e9s d'un fonds pour aider les pays vuln\u00e9rables \u00e0 faire face aux pertes et pr\u00e9judices caus\u00e9s par le changement climatique"},"4":{"Display":"\u00c9largir le Conseil de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 de l'ONU (charg\u00e9 du maintien de la paix) \u00e0 de nouveaux membres permanents tels que l'Inde, le Br\u00e9sil et l'Union africaine, et y restreindre l'usage du droit de veto"},"5":{"Display":"Augmenter de 15% \u00e0 35% le taux minimum d'imposition des profits des multinationales adopt\u00e9 au niveau mondial, \u00e9liminer les lacunes juridiques et allouer les recettes aux pays o\u00f9 les ventes sont r\u00e9alis\u00e9es"},"6":{"Display":"All\u00e9ger la dette des pays vuln\u00e9rables en suspendant les remboursements jusqu'\u00e0 ce qu'ils soient davantage en mesure de rembourser, favorisant ainsi leur d\u00e9veloppement"},"7":{"Display":"Un pr\u00e9l\u00e8vement sur les \u00e9missions de CO<sub>2<\/sub> du transport maritime, finan\u00e7ant les budgets des pays en proportion de leur population"},"8":{"Display":"Un pr\u00e9l\u00e8vement sur les \u00e9missions de CO<sub>2<\/sub> de l'aviation, augmentant le prix des vols de 30 % et finan\u00e7ant les budgets des pays en proportion de leur population"},"9":{"Display":"Que les pays d\u00e9velopp\u00e9s fournissent 300 milliards de dollars par an (0,4% de leur PIB) pour financer l'action climatique dans les pays en d\u00e9veloppement"},"10":{"Display":"Que les pays d\u00e9velopp\u00e9s contribuent au moins 0,7% de leur PIB \u00e0 l\u2019aide au d\u00e9veloppement des pays \u00e0 bas revenus"},"11":{"Display":"Un imp\u00f4t minimum de 2% sur la fortune des milliardaires, dans les pays volontaires"}},"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"Tr\u00e8s oppos\u00e9\u22c5e"},"2":{"Display":"Plut\u00f4t oppos\u00e9"},"3":{"Display":"Indiff\u00e9rent\u22c5e ou ne sais pas"},"4":{"Display":"Plut\u00f4t favorable"},"5":{"Display":"Tr\u00e8s favorable"}}}},"NextChoiceId":12,"NextAnswerId":6,"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"Strongly oppose"},"2":{"Display":"Somewhat oppose"},"3":{"Display":"Indifferent"},"4":{"Display":"Somewhat support"},"5":{"Display":"Strongly support"}},"AnswerOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"ChoiceDataExportTags":false,"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"},"AnswerColumns":5,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Do you support or oppose the following policies?<br><br><span id=\"developed_note_long\">[developed_note_long: (As some items refer to \"developed countries\", note that we consider Saudi Arabia to be a developed country in this question.)]<\/span>","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\t\/\/ Loads CSV and create variables from the column corresponding to Q_Language\n\t$j(document).ready(function($j){\t\n\t\t$j.ajax({\n\t\t\turl:\"https:\/\/wumarketing.eu.qualtrics.com\/ControlPanel\/File.php?F=F_yuKEs6pwxsAid44\",\n\t\t\tsuccess: function(csv){\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tconst language = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"Q_Language\"); \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tconst rows = csv.split('\\n').map(row => row.split('|'));\n\t\t\tconst headers = rows[0];\n\t\t\tconst col = headers.indexOf(language);\n\n\t\t\tif (col === -1) {\n\t\t\t\tconsole.error(\"Column 'language' not found in the CSV file.\");\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t\/\/ Iterate through the rows and create variables dynamically\n\t\t\tfor (let i = 1; i < rows.length-1; i++) {\n\t\t\t\tconst name = rows[i][0]; \/\/ Assuming the row name is in the first column\n\t\t\t\tconst value = rows[i][col];\n\t\t\t\twindow[name] = value; \n\t\t\t\t$j(\"#\" + name).html(value);\n\t\t\t\tconsole.log(`Variable ${name} created with value: ${value}`);\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\terror: function(){ alert('Data could not be loaded');}\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">long<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Greater Than<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 0.42 <\/span>","LeftOperand":"long","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"GreaterThan","RightOperand":"0.42","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID70","SecondaryAttribute":"Now think about people's incomes. Your best guess is fine. What percent of U.S. residents earn:","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,"5"],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Less than $25,000"},"2":{"Display":"$25,000-$50,000"},"3":{"Display":"$50,001-$75,000"},"4":{"Display":"$75,001-$100,000"},"5":{"Display":"More than $100,000"}},"Configuration":{"CSSliderMax":100,"CSSliderMin":0,"CustomStart":false,"GridLines":4,"MobileFirst":true,"NotApplicable":false,"NumDecimals":"0","QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","ShowValue":false,"SnapToGrid":false},"DataExportTag":"Q70","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Labels":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":6,"QuestionDescription":"Now think about people's incomes. Your best guess is fine. What percent of U.S. residents earn:","QuestionID":"QID70","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function() {\n\tmfCsSliders(this);\n});","QuestionText":"Now think about people's incomes. Your best guess is fine. What percent of U.S. residents earn:","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Now think about people's incomes. Your best guess is fine. What percent of U.S. residents earn:","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","Validation":{"Settings":{"CustomValidation":{"Logic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/1","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">In the past 12 months, how much of your online shopping would you estimate you do on each of the...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Computer<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> $e{ 100 - q:\/\/QID1\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/2 - q:\/\/QID1\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/3 - q:\/\/QID1\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/4 } <\/span>","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"EqualTo","QuestionID":"QID1","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","RightOperand":"$e{ 100 - q:\/\/QID1\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/2 - q:\/\/QID1\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/3 - q:\/\/QID1\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/4 }","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression"},"Message":{"description":"mfCsSlider must = 100","libraryID":"GR_cuUCjVgVrXJvxIh","messageID":"MS_8Iclv1Gj08Pz7eu","subMessageID":"VE_CUSTOM_VALIDATION_0"}},"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"CustomValidation"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID71","SecondaryAttribute":"Click to write the question text","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Click to write the question text","DataExportTag":"Q71","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Click to write the question text","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 1"},"2":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 2"},"3":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 3"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID71"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID72","SecondaryAttribute":"Imagine a national tax on individuals with net worth above [wealth_threshold: $1 million]. Only w...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Imagine a national tax on individuals with net worth above [wealth_threshold: $1 million]. \r\nOnly wealth above [wealth_threshold: $1 million] would be taxed, at a rate of 2%. The government would retain 70% of the revenues it collects, while 30% would finance public services in low-income countries (in particular, access to drinking water, healthcare, and education in Africa).\r\n\r\nDo you support [country_name: the United States] adopting this national tax on millionaires?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"hic_tax_support","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Imagine a national tax on individuals with net worth above [wealth_threshold: $1 million]. Only w...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":{"FR":{"QuestionText":"<strong>Imaginez un imp\u00f4t international sur les millionnaires.<\/strong><br \/>\nSeule la fortune au-del\u00e0 de <span class=\"wealth_threshold\">1 million<\/span> d'euros serait tax\u00e9e, au taux de 2\u00a0%. Chaque pays conserverait 70\u00a0% des revenus qu\u2019il collecte, tandis que 30\u00a0% seraient mis en commun au niveau mondial pour financer les services publics dans les pays \u00e0 bas revenus (notamment l\u2019acc\u00e8s \u00e0 l\u2019eau potable, la sant\u00e9 et l\u2019\u00e9ducation en Afrique).<br \/>\n<br \/>\nDisons que nous sommes en 2030. <strong><span class=\"hic_tax\">Imaginez que tous les autres pays \u00e0 hauts revenus (comme l\u2019Union europ\u00e9enne, le Japon et le Canada) adoptent cette mesure et que certains pays \u00e0 revenu interm\u00e9diaire (comme la Chine) ne le font pas.<\/span><br \/>\nSoutenez-vous l\u2019adoption par <span id=\"country_name\">les \u00c9tats-Unis<\/span> de cette taxe internationale sur les millionnaires\u00a0?<\/strong>","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Oui"},"2":{"Display":"Non"}}}},"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID72","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<b>Imagine an international tax on individuals with net worth above <span class=\"wealth_threshold\">[wealth_threshold: $1 million]<\/span>.&nbsp;<\/b><br>Only wealth above <span class=\"wealth_threshold\">[wealth_threshold: $1 million]<\/span> would be taxed, at a rate of 2%. Each country would retain 70% of the revenues it collects, while 30% would be pooled at the global level to finance public services in low-income countries (in particular, access to drinking water, healthcare, and education in Africa). <br><br>Say we are in 2030. <b><span id=\"hic_tax\">[hic_tax: Imagine that all other high-income countries (such as the European Union, Japan, and Canada) adopt this policy and some middle-income countries (such as China) do not.]<\/b><\/span><b>&nbsp;<br>Do you support <span id=\"country_name\">[country_name: the United States]<\/span> adopting this international tax on millionaires?<\/b><br>","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"time_ncqg_maritime\", Date.now()\/1000);\n\tconst time_before = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"time_warm_glow_realism\");\n\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"duration_ncqg_maritime\", Date.now()\/1000 - time_before);\n\t\n\t\/\/ Loads CSV and create variables from the column corresponding to Q_Language\n\t$j(document).ready(function($j){\t\n\t\t$j.ajax({\n\t\t\turl:\"https:\/\/wumarketing.eu.qualtrics.com\/ControlPanel\/File.php?F=F_yuKEs6pwxsAid44\",\n\t\t\tsuccess: function(csv){\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tconst language = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"Q_Language\"); \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tconst rows = csv.split('\\n').map(row => row.split('|'));\n\t\t\tconst headers = rows[0];\n\t\t\tconst col = headers.indexOf(language);\n\n\t\t\tif (col === -1) {\n\t\t\t\tconsole.error(\"Column 'language' not found in the CSV file.\");\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t\/\/ Iterate through the rows and create variables dynamically\n\t\t\tfor (let i = 1; i < rows.length-1; i++) {\n\t\t\t\tconst name = rows[i][0]; \/\/ Assuming the row name is in the first column\n\t\t\t\tconst value = rows[i][col];\n\t\t\t\twindow[name] = value; \n\t\t\t\t$j(\"#\" + name).html(value);\n\t\t\t\t$j(\".\" + name).html(value);\n\t\t\t\tconsole.log(`Variable ${name} created with value: ${value}`);\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\terror: function(){ alert('Data could not be loaded');}\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID73","SecondaryAttribute":"Imaginez une taxe internationale sur les millionnaires. Seule la fortune au-del\u00e0 de 1 million d'e..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Imaginez une taxe internationale sur les millionnaires.<\/b><br>\nSeule la fortune au-del\u00e0 de 1 million d'euros serait tax\u00e9e, au taux de 2%. Chaque pays conserverait 70% des revenus qu\u2019il collecte, tandis que 30% seraient mutualis\u00e9s au niveau mondial pour financer les services publics des pays \u00e0 bas revenus (notamment l\u2019acc\u00e8s \u00e0 l\u2019eau potable, la sant\u00e9 et l\u2019\u00e9ducation en Afrique).<br>\n<br>\nDisons que nous sommes en 2030. <b>Imaginez que certains pays (tels que l'Allemagne, l'Espagne, le Royaume-Uni, le Br\u00e9sil...) adoptent cette mesure et que d'autres pays (tels que les \u00c9tats-Unis et la Chine) ne l'adoptent pas.<br>\nSoutenez-vous l\u2019adoption par la France de cette taxe internationale sur les millionnaires ?<\/b>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"intl_tax_support","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Imaginez une taxe internationale sur les millionnaires. Seule la fortune au-del\u00e0 de 1 million d'e...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Oui"},"2":{"Display":"Non"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":{"FR":{"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Oui"},"2":{"Display":"Non"}}}},"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID73","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<b>Imagine an international tax on individuals with net worth above <span class=\"wealth_threshold\">[wealth_threshold: $1 million]<\/span>.&nbsp;<\/b><br>Only wealth above <span class=\"wealth_threshold\">[wealth_threshold: $1 million]<\/span> would be taxed, at a rate of 2%. Each country would retain 70% of the revenues it collects, while 30% would be pooled at the global level to finance public services in low-income countries (in particular, access to drinking water, healthcare, and education in Africa). <br><br>Say we are in 2030.<b> <span id=\"intl_tax\">[intl_tax: Imagine that some countries  (such as the European Union) adopt this policy and others (such as Japan, Canada, and China) do not.]<\/span><br>Do you support <span id=\"country_name\">[country_name: the United States]<\/span> adopting this international tax on millionaires?<\/b><br>","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"time_gcs\", Date.now()\/1000);\n\tconst time_before = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"time_wtp\");\n\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"duration_gcs\", Date.now()\/1000 - time_before);\n\t\n\t$j(document).ready(function($j){\t\n\t\t$j.ajax({\n\t\t\turl:\"https:\/\/wumarketing.eu.qualtrics.com\/ControlPanel\/File.php?F=F_yuKEs6pwxsAid44\",\n\t\t\tsuccess: function(csv){\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tconst language = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"Q_Language\"); \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tconst rows = csv.split('\\n').map(row => row.split('|'));\n\t\t\tconst headers = rows[0];\n\t\t\tconst col = headers.indexOf(language);\n\n\t\t\tif (col === -1) {\n\t\t\t\tconsole.error(\"Column 'language' not found in the CSV file.\");\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t\/\/ Iterate through the rows and create variables dynamically\n\t\t\tfor (let i = 1; i < rows.length-1; i++) {\n\t\t\t\tconst name = rows[i][0]; \/\/ Assuming the row name is in the first column\n\t\t\t\tconst value = rows[i][col];\n\t\t\t\twindow[name] = value; \n\t\t\t\t$j(\".\" + name).html(value);\n\t\t\t\t$j(\"#\" + name).html(value);\n\t\t\t\tconsole.log(`Variable ${name} created with value: ${value}`);\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\terror: function(){ alert('Data could not be loaded');}\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID74","SecondaryAttribute":"Currently, 3 billion people live in deep poverty, with less than [lcu_400: $400][periodicity: per...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Currently, 3 billion people live in deep poverty, with less than <span class=\"lcu_400\">[lcu_400: $400]<\/span><span class=\"periodicity\">[periodicity: per month]<\/span>.<br>The Sustainable Development Goals, adopted by all countries in 2015, aim to alleviate poverty and achieve access to healthcare, education, drinking water, and sanitation for all by 2030.&nbsp;Due to lack of funding, the world is not on track to meet these poverty reduction goals.<br><br><b>Poverty reduction could be funded by a global tax on individual income above <span class=\"lcu_80k\">[lcu_80k: $80,000]<\/span><span class=\"periodicity_tax\">[periodicity_tax: per year]<\/span>.&nbsp;<br>The tax rate would be 15% for every <span class=\"currency\">[currency: dollar]<\/span> over <span class=\"lcu_80k\">[lcu_80k: $80,000]<\/span> of income<\/b> after existing taxes, <b>30% over <span id=\"lcu_120k\">[lcu_120k: $120,000]<\/span>, and 45% over <span id=\"lcu_1M\">[lcu_1M: $1 million]<\/span>.&nbsp;<\/b><br>For example, a single person earning <span class=\"lcu_90k\">[lcu_90k: $90,000]<\/span><span class=\"periodicity_tax\">[periodicity_tax: per year]<\/span> after taxes would pay <span id=\"lcu_1500_top3\">[lcu_1500_top3: $1,500]<\/span> in additional taxes, or 15% of <span id=\"lcu_10k_top3\">[lcu_10k_top3: $10,000]<\/span> = <span class=\"lcu_90k\">[lcu_90k: $90,000]<\/span>&nbsp;&ndash;&nbsp;<span class=\"lcu_80k\">[lcu_80k: $80,000]<\/span>. Meanwhile, a married couple earning <span id=\"lcu_150k\">[lcu_150k: $150,000]<\/span><span class=\"periodicity_tax\">[periodicity_tax: per year]<\/span>, <span id=\"lcu_75k\">[lcu_75k: $75,000]<\/span> for each of them, would go untaxed.<br>This tax would apply to the richest 3% of the world's population. <span id=\"tax_country_name\">[tax_country_name: In the United States]<\/span>, it would affect the richest <span id=\"affected_top3\">[affected_top3: 18]<\/span>% and redistribute <span id=\"transfer_top3\">[transfer_top3: 8]<\/span>% of GDP to lower-income countries.<br><br><b>Do you support or oppose such a global tax on the richest people to finance global poverty reduction?<\/b><br>","DataExportTag":"top3_tax_support","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Currently, 3 billion people live in deep poverty, with less than [lcu_400: $400][periodicity: per...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Strongly oppose"},"2":{"Display":"Somewhat support"},"3":{"Display":"Strongly support"},"4":{"Display":"Somewhat oppose"},"5":{"Display":"Indifferent"}},"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">variant_radical_redistr<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 1 <\/span>","LeftOperand":"variant_radical_redistr","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"1","Type":"Expression"},"1":{"Conjuction":"And","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">And<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">long<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Greater Than<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 0.42 <\/span>","LeftOperand":"long","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"GreaterThan","RightOperand":"0.42","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"ChoiceOrder":["1","4","5","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":{"FR":{"QuestionText":"Actuellement, 3 milliards de personnes vivent en situation de pauvret\u00e9 profonde, avec moins de <span class=\"lcu_400\">[lcu_400\u00a0: 400\u00a0$]<\/span> <span class=\"periodicity\">[p\u00e9riodicit\u00e9\u00a0: par mois]<\/span>.<br \/>\nLes Objectifs de d\u00e9veloppement durable, adopt\u00e9s par tous les pays en 2015, visent \u00e0 r\u00e9duire la pauvret\u00e9 et \u00e0 assurer l\u2019acc\u00e8s aux soins, \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9ducation, \u00e0 l\u2019eau potable et \u00e0 l\u2019assainissement pour tous d\u2019ici 2030. Le monde n\u2019est pas sur la bonne voie pour atteindre ces objectifs de r\u00e9duction de la pauvret\u00e9 en raison du manque de financement.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<b>La r\u00e9duction de la pauvret\u00e9 pourrait \u00eatre financ\u00e9e par un imp\u00f4t mondial sur les revenus sup\u00e9rieurs \u00e0 <span class=\"lcu_80k\">[lcu_80k\u00a0: 80\u00a0000\u00a0$]<\/span><span class=\"periodicity_tax\">[periodicity_tax\u00a0: par an]<\/span>.<br \/>\nLe taux d'imposition serait de 15\u00a0% pour chaque dollar au-del\u00e0 de <span class=\"lcu_80k\">[lcu_80k: 80 000 $]<\/span> de revenu apr\u00e8s imp\u00f4ts existants, de 30\u00a0% au-del\u00e0 de <span id=\"lcu_120k\">[lcu_120k: 120 000 $]<\/span> et de 45\u00a0% au-del\u00e0 de <span id=\"lcu_1M\">[lcu_1M: 1 million $]<\/span>.<\/b><br \/>\nPar exemple, une personne seule gagnant <span class=\"lcu_90k\">[lcu_90k: 90\u00a0000 $]<\/span><span class=\"periodicity_tax\">[periodicity_tax: par an]<\/span> apr\u00e8s imp\u00f4ts paierait <span id=\"lcu_1500_top3\">[lcu_1500_top3: 1\u00a0500 $]<\/span> d'imp\u00f4ts suppl\u00e9mentaires, soit 15\u00a0% de <span id=\"lcu_10k_top3\">[lcu_10k_top3: 10\u00a0000 $]<\/span> = <span class=\"lcu_90k\">[lcu_90k: 90\u00a0000 $]<\/span> - <span class=\"lcu_80k\">[lcu_80k: 80\u00a0000 $]<\/span>. En revanche, un couple mari\u00e9 gagnant <span id=\"lcu_150k\">[lcu_150k\u00a0: 150\u00a0000\u00a0$]<\/span><span class=\"periodicity_tax\">[periodicity_tax\u00a0: par an]<\/span>, <span id=\"lcu_75k\">[lcu_75k\u00a0: 75\u00a0000\u00a0$]<\/span> pour chacun d'eux, ne serait pas impos\u00e9.<br \/>\nCet imp\u00f4t s\u2019appliquerait aux 3\u00a0% les plus riches de la population mondiale. <span id=\"tax_country_name\">[tax_country_name: Aux \u00c9tats-Unis]<\/span>, cela affecterait les <span id=\"affected_top3\">[affected_top3: 18]<\/span>\u00a0% les plus riches et redistribuerait <span id=\"transfer_top3\">[transfer_top3: 8]<\/span>\u00a0% du PIB aux pays \u00e0 bas revenus.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<b>\u00cates-vous favorable ou oppos\u00e9\u22c5e \u00e0 une telle taxe mondiale sur les personnes les plus riches pour financer la r\u00e9duction de la pauvret\u00e9 dans le monde\u00a0?<\/b>","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Tr\u00e8s oppos\u00e9\u22c5e"},"2":{"Display":"Plut\u00f4t favorable"},"3":{"Display":"Tr\u00e8s favorable"},"4":{"Display":"Plut\u00f4t oppos\u00e9\u22c5e"},"5":{"Display":"Indiff\u00e9rent\u22c5e ou ne sais pas"}}}},"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID74","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Currently, 3 billion people live in deep poverty, with less than <span class=\"lcu_400\">[lcu_400: $400]<\/span><span class=\"periodicity\">[periodicity: per month]<\/span>.<br>The Sustainable Development Goals, adopted by all countries in 2015, aim to alleviate poverty and achieve access to healthcare, education, drinking water, and sanitation for all by 2030.&nbsp;Due to lack of funding, the world is not on track to meet these poverty reduction goals.<br><br><b>Poverty reduction could be funded by a global tax on individual income above <span class=\"lcu_80k\">[lcu_80k: $80,000]<\/span><span class=\"periodicity_tax\">[periodicity_tax: per year]<\/span>.&nbsp;<br>The tax rate would be 15% for every <span class=\"currency\">[currency: dollar]<\/span> over <span class=\"lcu_80k\">[lcu_80k: $80,000]<\/span> of income<\/b> after existing taxes, <b>30% over <span id=\"lcu_120k\">[lcu_120k: $120,000]<\/span>, and 45% over <span id=\"lcu_1M\">[lcu_1M: $1 million]<\/span>.&nbsp;<\/b><br>For example, a single person earning <span class=\"lcu_90k\">[lcu_90k: $90,000]<\/span><span class=\"periodicity_tax\">[periodicity_tax: per year]<\/span> after taxes would pay <span id=\"lcu_1500_top3\">[lcu_1500_top3: $1,500]<\/span> in additional taxes, or 15% of <span id=\"lcu_10k_top3\">[lcu_10k_top3: $10,000]<\/span> = <span class=\"lcu_90k\">[lcu_90k: $90,000]<\/span>&nbsp;&ndash;&nbsp;<span class=\"lcu_80k\">[lcu_80k: $80,000]<\/span>. Meanwhile, a married couple earning <span id=\"lcu_150k\">[lcu_150k: $150,000]<\/span><span class=\"periodicity_tax\">[periodicity_tax: per year]<\/span>, <span id=\"lcu_75k\">[lcu_75k: $75,000]<\/span> for each of them, would go untaxed.<br>This tax would apply to the richest 3% of the world's population. <span id=\"tax_country_name\">[tax_country_name: In the United States]<\/span>, it would affect the richest <span id=\"affected_top3\">[affected_top3: 18]<\/span>% and redistribute <span id=\"transfer_top3\">[transfer_top3: 8]<\/span>% of GDP to lower-income countries.<br><br><b>Do you support or oppose such a global tax on the richest people to finance global poverty reduction?<\/b><br>","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\t\/\/ Loads CSV and create variables from the column corresponding to Q_Language\n\t$j(document).ready(function($j){\t\n\t\t$j.ajax({\n\t\t\turl:\"https:\/\/wumarketing.eu.qualtrics.com\/ControlPanel\/File.php?F=F_yuKEs6pwxsAid44\",\n\t\t\tsuccess: function(csv){\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tconst language = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"Q_Language\"); \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tconst rows = csv.split('\\n').map(row => row.split('|'));\n\t\t\tconst headers = rows[0];\n\t\t\tconst col = headers.indexOf(language);\n\n\t\t\tif (col === -1) {\n\t\t\t\tconsole.error(\"Column 'language' not found in the CSV file.\");\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t\/\/ Iterate through the rows and create variables dynamically\n\t\t\tfor (let i = 1; i < rows.length-1; i++) {\n\t\t\t\tconst name = rows[i][0]; \/\/ Assuming the row name is in the first column\n\t\t\t\tconst value = rows[i][col];\n\t\t\t\twindow[name] = value; \n\t\t\t\t$j(\"#\" + name).html(value);\n\t\t\t\t$j(\".\" + name).html(value);\n\t\t\t\tconsole.log(`Variable ${name} created with value: ${value}`);\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\terror: function(){ alert('Data could not be loaded');}\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID75","SecondaryAttribute":"Click to write the question text","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Click to write the question text","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q75","QuestionID":"QID75","QuestionType":"Meta","Selector":"Browser","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Click to write the question text","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Browser","TextEntry":1},"2":{"Display":"Version","TextEntry":1},"3":{"Display":"Operating System","TextEntry":1},"4":{"Display":"Screen Resolution","TextEntry":1},"5":{"Display":"Flash Version","TextEntry":1},"6":{"Display":"Java Support","TextEntry":1},"7":{"Display":"User Agent","TextEntry":1}},"Validation":"None","GradingData":[],"Language":{"FR":{"QuestionText":"Cliquez pour \u00e9crire le texte de la question","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Navigateur"},"2":{"Display":"Version"},"3":{"Display":"Syst\u00e8me op\u00e9rateur"},"4":{"Display":"R\u00e9solution d&#39;\u00e9cran"},"5":{"Display":"Version Flash"},"6":{"Display":"Prise en charge Java"},"7":{"Display":"Agent utilisateur"}}}},"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Click to write the question text"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID76","SecondaryAttribute":"Consid\u00e9rez deux sc\u00e9narios possibles pour le monde dans les 20 prochaines ann\u00e9es. Sc\u00e9nario A : La","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Consid\u00e9rez deux sc\u00e9narios possibles pour le monde dans les 20 prochaines ann\u00e9es.<br>\n<br>\nSc\u00e9nario A<\/b> :<br>\nLa plupart des pays mettent en \u0153uvre des politiques coordonn\u00e9es pour limiter le r\u00e9chauffement climatique \u00e0 +2\u00b0C et r\u00e9duire les in\u00e9galit\u00e9s. Le monde r\u00e9duit consid\u00e9rablement les \u00e9missions de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre et est en bonne voie pour atteindre l'objectif climatique. Des imp\u00f4ts sur les millionnaires financent l\u2019installation de pompes \u00e0 chaleur, l\u2019isolation thermique des b\u00e2timents et l\u2019am\u00e9lioration des transports publics. Les yachts et les jets priv\u00e9s sont progressivement supprim\u00e9s dans le monde entier. Les voitures sont enti\u00e8rement \u00e9lectriques d\u2019ici 2045 et co\u00fbtent \u00e0 peu pr\u00e8s le m\u00eame prix que les voitures thermiques d\u2019aujourd\u2019hui. D\u2019ici 2045, les r\u00e9glementations environnementales multiplient progressivement par deux le prix du b\u0153uf, du fioul ou du gaz de chauffage, et du transport a\u00e9rien. En cons\u00e9quence, les gens prennent l\u2019avion deux fois moins souvent, mangent deux fois moins de viande et utilisent davantage les transports en commun en 2045 qu\u2019en 2025.&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\n<b>Sc\u00e9nario B<\/b> :<br>\nDepuis 2025, aucune mesure suppl\u00e9mentaire n\u2019est mise en \u0153uvre pour lutter contre le changement climatique ou les in\u00e9galit\u00e9s. Les gens maintiennent le m\u00eame mode de vie qu\u2019en 2025. Par exemple, la plupart des gens continuent de conduire des voitures thermiques. Les \u00e9missions de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre sont stables. Le r\u00e9chauffement climatique devrait atteindre +3\u00b0C d\u2019ici 2100 et des niveaux plus \u00e9lev\u00e9s au-del\u00e0 de cette date. Le changement climatique entra\u00eene des s\u00e9cheresses, des vagues de chaleur, des incendies de for\u00eat et des inondations c\u00f4ti\u00e8res plus fr\u00e9quents et plus graves.<br>\n<br>\nHormis les \u00e9l\u00e9ments d\u00e9crits, les deux sc\u00e9narios sont identiques (par exemple, en termes de ch\u00f4mage ou de criminalit\u00e9).<br>\n<br>\n<b>Quel sc\u00e9nario pr\u00e9f\u00e9rez-vous pour l\u2019avenir ?<\/b>","DataExportTag":"sustainable_future_n","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Consid\u00e9rez deux sc\u00e9narios possibles pour le monde dans les 20 prochaines ann\u00e9es. Sc\u00e9nario A : La...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Sc\u00e9nario A"},"2":{"Display":"Sc\u00e9nario B"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":{"FR":{"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Sc\u00e9nario\u00a0A"},"2":{"Display":"Sc\u00e9nario B"}}}},"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID76","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<b>Consider two possible scenarios for the world for the next 20 years.&nbsp;<br><br>Scenario A<\/b>:<br>Since 2025, no additional policies are implemented to address climate change or inequality. People maintain the same lifestyles as in 2025. For example, most people continue to drive cars with internal combustion engines. Greenhouse gas emissions are stable. Global warming is expected to reach +3\u00b0C by 2100 and higher levels beyond that date. A warmer climate will cause more frequent and more severe droughts, heatwaves, wildfires, and floodings.<br><br><b>Scenario B<\/b>: <br>Most countries implement coordinated policies to limit global warming to +2\u00b0C and reduce inequality. The world greatly reduces greenhouse gas emissions and is on track to meet its climate target. Taxes on millionaires fund the installation of heat pumps, the thermal insulation of buildings, and improved public transportation. Yachts and private jets are phased out worldwide. Cars are all electric by 2045, and they are about the same price as internal combustion cars nowadays. By 2045, environmental regulations gradually double the price of heating fuel or gas, air travel, and beef. As a result, people fly half as much, eat half as much meat, and use more public transportation in 2045 than they did in 2025. Despite higher prices for polluting goods, the overall purchasing power is preserved, thanks to a decrease in sales tax that reduces the prices of non-polluting goods.<br><br>Apart from the elements described, the two scenarios are the same (for example, in terms of unemployment or crime). <br><br><b>Which scenario do you prefer for the future?<\/b>","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"time_global_inheritance\", Date.now()\/1000);\n\tconst time_before = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"time_wealth_tax\");\n\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"duration_global_inheritance\", Date.now()\/1000 - time_before);\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is fully displayed*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID77","SecondaryAttribute":"Do you support [ics_country: the U.S.] joining the Global Climate Scheme, in case it is adopted b...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Do you support <span class=\"ics_country\">[ics_country: the U.S.]<\/span> joining the Global Climate Scheme, in case it is adopted by the above countries?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"ics_support","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Do you support [ics_country: the U.S.] joining the Global Climate Scheme, in case it is adopted b...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":{"FR":{"QuestionText":"Soutenez-vous l\u2019adh\u00e9sion de <span class=\"ics_country\">l'UE<\/span> au Plan mondial pour le climat, dans l'\u00e9ventualit\u00e9 o\u00f9 il serait adopt\u00e9 par les pays ci-dessus ?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Oui"},"2":{"Display":"Non"}}}},"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID77","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Do you support <span class=\"ics_country\">[ics_country: the U.S.]<\/span> joining the Global Climate Scheme, in case it is adopted by the above countries?","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\t\/\/ Loads CSV and create variables from the column corresponding to Q_Language\n\t$j(document).ready(function($j){\t\n\t\t$j.ajax({\n\t\t\turl:\"https:\/\/wumarketing.eu.qualtrics.com\/ControlPanel\/File.php?F=F_yuKEs6pwxsAid44\",\n\t\t\tsuccess: function(csv){\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tconst language = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"Q_Language\"); \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tconst rows = csv.split('\\n').map(row => row.split('|'));\n\t\t\tconst headers = rows[0];\n\t\t\tconst col = headers.indexOf(language);\n\n\t\t\tif (col === -1) {\n\t\t\t\tconsole.error(\"Column 'language' not found in the CSV file.\");\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t\/\/ Iterate through the rows and create variables dynamically\n\t\t\tfor (let i = 1; i < rows.length-1; i++) {\n\t\t\t\tconst name = rows[i][0]; \/\/ Assuming the row name is in the first column\n\t\t\t\tconst value = rows[i][col];\n\t\t\t\twindow[name] = value; \n\t\t\t\t$j(\"#\" + name).html(value);\n\t\t\t\t$j(\".\" + name).html(value);\n\t\t\t\tconsole.log(`Variable ${name} created with value: ${value}`);\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\terror: function(){ alert('Data could not be loaded');}\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID78","SecondaryAttribute":"Bienvenue dans cette enqu\u00eate ! Cette enqu\u00eate est anonyme et est men\u00e9e \u00e0 des fins de recherche. E","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Bienvenue dans cette enqu\u00eate !<br>\n<br>\nCette enqu\u00eate est <b>anonyme<\/b> et est men\u00e9e <b>\u00e0 des fins de recherche<\/b>.<br>\n<br>\nElle prend environ 20 minutes.<br><br>\nEn cliquant sur le bouton ci-dessous, vous acceptez les <a href=\"https:\/\/wumarketing.eu.qualtrics.com\/ControlPanel\/File.php?F=F_cWOE4xE7sx1C9do\">conditions g\u00e9n\u00e9rales d'utilisation<\/a>.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"consent","QuestionID":"QID78","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Bienvenue dans cette enqu\u00eate ! Cette enqu\u00eate est anonyme et est men\u00e9e \u00e0 des fins de recherche. El...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":{"FR":[]},"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Welcome to this survey!<br>\nThis survey is <b>anonymous <\/b>and is conducted <b>for research<\/b> purposes on a representative sample of <span id=\"sample_size\">[sample_size: 3,000]<\/span> <span id=\"nationality\">[nationality: American people]<\/span>.<br>\n<br>\nIt takes around 20 min to complete.<br>\n<br>\nThe survey contains lotteries and awards for those who get the correct answer to some comprehension questions.<br>\nIf you are attentive and lucky, <b>you can win up to <span class=\"amount_lottery\">[amount_lottery: $100]<\/span><\/b>.<br>\n<br>\nPlease answer every question carefully.<br>\n<br>\nBy clicking on the button below, you consent to the <a href=\"https:\/\/wumarketing.eu.qualtrics.com\/ControlPanel\/File.php?F=F_cWOE4xE7sx1C9do\">terms and conditions<\/a>.","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page loads*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"time_start\", Date.now()\/1000);\n\t\n\tvar tz = Intl.DateTimeFormat().resolvedOptions().timeZone;\n    var locale = navigator.language || navigator.userLanguage;\n    Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"SystemTimeZone\", tz);\n    Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"SystemLocale\", locale);\n\t\n\tconst language = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"Q_Language\");\n\tvar country = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"country\");\n\tif (language && (country == null)) {\n\t\tif (language) {\n\t\t\tcountry = \"CH\";\n\t\t} else if (language == \"AR\") {\n\t\t\tcountry = \"SA\";\n\t\t} else if (language == \"JA\") {\n\t\t\tcountry = \"JP\";\n\t\t} else if (language.includes(\"GB\") || language.includes(\"UK\")) {\n\t\t\tcountry = \"GB\";\n\t\t} else if (language.includes(\"ES\")) {\n\t\t\tcountry = \"ES\";\n\t\t} else if (language.includes(\"US\") || (language == \"SQI\") || (language == \"EN\")) {\n\t\t\tcountry = \"US\";\n\t\t} else { country = language; }\n\t}\t\n\t\n\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"country\", country);\n\t\n\t$j.ajax({\n\t\turl:\"https:\/\/wumarketing.eu.qualtrics.com\/ControlPanel\/File.php?F=F_yuKEs6pwxsAid44\",\n\t\tsuccess: function(csv){\n\n\t\t\tconst language = Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.getEmbeddedData(\"Q_Language\"); \n\n\t\t\tconst rows = csv.split('\\n').map(row => row.split('|'));\n\t\t\tconst headers = rows[0];\n\t\t\tconst col = headers.indexOf(language);\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tif (col === -1) {\n\t\t\t\tconsole.error(\"Column 'language' not found in the CSV file.\");\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t\/\/ Iterate through the rows and create variables dynamically\n\t\t\tfor (let i = 1; i < rows.length-1; i++) {\n\t\t\t\tconst name = rows[i][0]; \/\/ Assuming the row name is in the first column\n\t\t\t\tconst value = rows[i][col];\n\t\t\t\twindow[name] = value; \n\t\t\t\t$j(\"#\" + name).html(value);\n\t\t\t\t$j(\".\" + name).html(value);\n\t\t\t\tconsole.log(`Variable ${name} created with value: ${value}`);\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t},\n\t\terror: function(){ alert('Data could not be loaded');}\n\t});\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_abLGdxn76dMdkCq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID79","SecondaryAttribute":"\u00cates-vous n\u00e9\u22c5e ou vos parents sont-ils n\u00e9s dans un pays \u00e9tranger ?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"\u00cates-vous n\u00e9\u22c5e ou vos parents sont-ils n\u00e9s dans un pays \u00e9tranger ?","DataExportTag":"foreign","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","D